<file path="README.md">
# 👥 KeenKeeper — Keep Your Friendships Alive

A relationship maintenance app that helps you stay in touch with the people who matter most.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **Next.js 16** (App Router) | React framework with file-based routing |
| **Tailwind CSS v4** | Utility-first styling |
| **Recharts** | Friendship analytics pie/donut chart |
| **React-Toastify** | Toast notifications for check-ins |
| **React Icons** | Icon library (HeroIcons set) |

## ✨ Key Features

1. **Friend Dashboard** — View all 8 friends in a responsive 4-column grid with live status badges (On-Track, Almost Due, Overdue) derived from your contact history
2. **Quick Check-In** — Log a Call, Text, or Video interaction from any friend's detail page; entries instantly appear on the Timeline with a toast confirmation
3. **Friendship Analytics** — Interactive donut chart on the Stats page showing your interaction breakdown by type (Call / Text / Video / Meetup)

Open [https://b13-a7-keen-keeper-psi.vercel.app/](https://b13-a7-keen-keeper-psi.vercel.app/)

## 📦 Build

```bash
npm run build
```

## 🌐 Live Link

[https://b13-a7-keen-keeper-psi.vercel.app/](https://b13-a7-keen-keeper-psi.vercel.app/)

## 📁 GitHub Repository

[https://github.com/shakilkhan95/b13-a7-keen-keeper](https://github.com/shakilkhan95/b13-a7-keen-keeper)
